    "notes": "The mapped monument matches Q337179. Nine mapped parts distinguish the shaft, raised terrace, curved walls and podium. The stair extension and photographed shield establish the southwest approach. The map anchors the apron, shaft, curved walls and boulevard axis. Sculpture proportions and most vertical details come from ordinary photographs and the sculpture plan. The figure poses, carving depths and smaller relief details are exterior reconstructions. The surrounding boulevard, park, canal and buildings remain in the host map. Physical-device timings are unmeasured."
  },
